Subject: [PATCH 2/2] tests: re-pin the serving sources the precision series
 changed

Seven rows of gradient-serving.tsv take the hash of this tree's own
file: cuda/ck.zig and the Flash Next loaders that pass --precision
through (cuda_lanes, cuda_lanes_load, cuda_mixed_experts,
cuda_modelopt_experts, cuda_prompt, cuda_prompt_load). The default
path's launches are unchanged.
